{%- comment -%}
  Tiered savings bar.

  Shows how far the cart is from the next saving, and fires a small burst when
  a tier is crossed. Thresholds and rewards are section settings so they can be
  changed without touching code.

  IMPORTANT — this bar displays progress. It does not itself discount anything.
  Shopify applies only one order-class automatic discount per order, so three
  overlapping automatic discounts cannot be relied on to resolve to the right
  tier. Whatever thresholds are set here must be mirrored by a discount that
  actually applies at checkout, or the cart promises money it does not deliver.
  See the note in the theme settings.

  Accepts:
  - tiers_json: {String} JSON array of { min, off, label }
  - context: {String} 'drawer' or 'page', for styling only
{%- endcomment -%}

<div
  class="mtier mtier--{{ context | default: 'page' }}"
  data-mastt-tiers
  data-tiers="{{ tiers_json | escape }}"
  data-total="{{ cart.total_price }}"
>
  <p class="mtier__msg" data-mtier-msg aria-live="polite"></p>

  <div class="mtier__track" data-mtier-track>
    <span class="mtier__fill" data-mtier-fill></span>
    <span class="mtier__nodes" data-mtier-nodes aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </div>

  <ul class="mtier__legend" data-mtier-legend role="list"></ul>
  <span class="mtier__burst" data-mtier-burst aria-hidden="true"></span>
</div>
